{"speciesId":569,"names":{"fr":"Miasmax","es":"Garbodor","en":"Garbodor","ja":"ダストダス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il étrangle ses ennemis avec son bras droit et les achève avec le gaz puant et empoisonné qu’il exhale par la bouche."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It clenches opponents with its left arm and finishes them off with foul-smelling poison gas belched from its mouth."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il aspire les déchets et les intègre à son corps. Les doigts de sa main droite exsudent un fluide empoisonné."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"They absorb garbage and make it part of their bodies. They shoot a poisonous liquid from their right-hand fingertips."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Consuming garbage makes new kinds of poison gases and liquids inside their bodies."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Consuming garbage makes new kinds of poison gases and liquids inside their bodies."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il étrangle ses ennemis avec son bras gauche et les achève avec le gaz puant et empoisonné qu’il exhale par la bouche."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Apresa a su rival con el brazo izquierdo y le da el golpe de gracia exhalando por la boca un apestoso gas venenoso."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It clenches opponents with its left arm and finishes them off with foul-smelling poison gas belched from its mouth."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"左腕で 相手を 絞めつけて 口から 吐き出す 悪臭の 毒ガスで とどめを 刺すのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il aspire les déchets et les intègre à son corps pour produire des gaz et des fluides toxiques."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Absorbe y procesa en su interior basura para generar nuevos gases nocivos y líquidos venenosos de alta virulencia."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Consuming garbage makes new kinds of poison gases and liquids inside their bodies."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"ゴミを 吸いとっては 体内で 新しい 種類の 毒ガスや 毒の 液体を 生みだしている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il étrangle ses ennemis avec son bras gauche et les achève avec le gaz puant et empoisonné qu’il exhale par la bouche."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Apresa a su rival con el brazo izquierdo y le da el golpe de gracia exhalando por la boca un apestoso gas venenoso."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It clenches opponents with its left arm and finishes them off with foul-smelling poison gas belched from its mouth."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"左腕で 相手を 絞めつけて 口から 吐き出す 悪臭の 毒ガスで とどめを 刺すのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il aspire les déchets et les intègre à son corps pour produire des gaz et des fluides toxiques."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Absorbe y procesa en su interior basura para generar nuevos gases nocivos y líquidos venenosos de alta virulencia."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Consuming garbage makes new kinds of poison gases and liquids inside their bodies."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"ゴミを 吸いとっては 体内で 新しい 種類の 毒ガスや 毒の 液体を 生みだしている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Méfiez-vous du poison qu’il projette de son bras droit, sans quoi ses toxines non identifiées vous feront passer un sale quart d’heure."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"El veneno líquido que brota de su brazo derecho es muy nocivo. La mera exposición puede llevar a inhalar accidentalmente toxinas desconocidas."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Beware the poisonous liquid it shoots from its right arm. If even a little of it gets on you, you’ll experience the effects of the unidentified toxin."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"右腕から 飛びだす 毒液に 注意。 ちょっと かかるだけで 未知の 毒素に 冒される。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il fut un temps où les Miasmax étaient LE fléau d’Alola. Heureusement, leur population a vite diminué après l’arrivée des Tadmorv."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Hubo un tiempo en el que la población de Garbodor en Alola era espectacular, pero su número se desplomó cuando llegaron los Grimer."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"For a time, their numbers increased explosively in Alola. Since the arrival of Grimer, their population has decreased dramatically."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"ある時期 アローラで 爆発的に 増えたが ベトベターが 来てからは その数は ガクンと 減った。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il maîtrise son adversaire de son bras gauche, puis l’arrose d’un liquide toxique paralysant."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Atrapa a su presa con el brazo izquierdo y luego rocía su cuerpo con un líquido venenoso para inmovilizarla."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It locks opponents in place with its left hand, immobilizing them by entirely dousing their bodies with poisonous liquid."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"左腕で 敵を ロックすると 毒の 液体を 体中に 浴びせかけ 身動きを 封じる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Ce serait pour pouvoir faire face à Grotadmorv, son ennemi juré, que le Miasmax d’Alola est légèrement plus robuste que les autres."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"La razón de la mayor fortaleza de los Garbodor que viven en la región de Alola se atribuye a la presencia de Muk, su enemigo natural."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Some say the reason Garbodor in Alola are a little stronger than their counterparts elsewhere is the presence of Muk, their natural enemy."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"アローラの ダストダスが 少し たくましいのは ベトベトンという 天敵が いるせいだと いわれる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il produit du poison dans son corps à partir des ordures qu’il ingurgite. Selon ce qu’il mange, la composition des toxines diffère."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Su cuerpo transforma la inmundicia que engulle en un veneno cuya composición cambia según la basura ingerida."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon eats trash, which turns into poison inside its body. The main component of the poison depends on what sort of trash was eaten."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"食った ゴミが 体内で 毒に 変化する。 食う ゴミ しだいで 毒の 主成分も 変わる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Le liquide qu’il projette de son bras droit est si toxique que si une créature fragile en est aspergée, elle succombe sur-le-champ."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"El veneno líquido que brota de su brazo derecho es tan nocivo que puede acabar con una criatura ya débil al menor contacto."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"The toxic liquid it launches from its right arm is so virulent that it can kill a weakened creature instantly."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"右腕から 出す 毒液は 弱った 生物が 浴びれば 即死するほど 危険な シロモノ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":569,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"double-slap","learns":[[11,"level-up",14],[14,"level-up",14],[15,"level-up",14],[16,"level-up",14],[17,"level-up",14],[18,"level-up",14]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[11,"level-up",25],[14,"level-up",25],[15,"level-up",25],[16,"level-up",25],[17,"level-up",25],[18,"level-up",25],[20,"level-up",24],[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"solar-beam","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"thunderbolt","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"toxic","lea